      <li><strong>Top app bar</strong> — stays fixed; the column scrolls, not the bar.</li>
      <li><strong>Drawer column</strong> — 280px permanent on wide screens; part of the grid, not a floating panel.</li>
      <li><strong>Nav rows</strong> — real links/buttons; the current destination gets the inset tinted pill via <code>aria-current="page"</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Content</strong> — the only scrolling area; capped by <code>--fl-content-max</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Scrim (mobile only)</strong> — under the drawer when it slides in; tap or Escape closes.</li>
